<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U says to acquire German company Elias.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U says to acquire German company Elias.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish/U.S. drugs company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn (P&amp;U) said on Wednesday that it had signed a contract to acquire the German diagnostics company Elias Medizintechnik GmbH in Freiburg.</p>
<p>Elias, which has about 120 employees, makes and markets diagnostic tests for auto-immunity, P&amp;U said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of Elias will allow P&amp;U to expand the use of its UniCAP line of diagnostic instruments to include auto-immunity diagnosis,&quot; P&amp;U said in a statement,</p>
<p>It said the UniCAP technology is currently used in allergy and asthma diagnostics.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
